Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 15:15:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Keep known prompt and completion prices when an optional
 surcharge is present.

A non-zero or unreadable surcharge is listed with its own amount and unit. It no longer replaces the quote with unknown, and it never becomes a summed total or a proven-zero price.
